{"items":[{"id":"802013682","root":"802013682","user":{"id":"969238","name":"想不出好玩id的过气老登","avatar":"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06"},"text":"谭谈交通05年首播，09年在成都广播电视台播出，18年停播，05到25，20年。\n“小时候”一词，一般指记事起（约3岁）到初三（15岁）所以按此推测，那么年龄段就是10到35之间，1900～2015。众所周知水姐属龙，分别是2024，2012，2000，1988，\n首先排除88年，超出范围。\n其次排除24年，a站的投稿最早显示为14年。\n然后排除12年，13岁，因为未成年禁止打赏。\n最后排除00年，水姐表现出来的细节证明一定不是00后。\n那么答案就呼之欲出了！是1001年！[emot=acfun,2762/]\n","time":1739946618932,"floor":6,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"802013910","root":"802013682","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"nonono，我们龙可没有生肖属性，证明失败[emot=acfun,2756/]","time":1739948166962,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"802016253","root":"802013682","user":{"id":"969238","name":"想不出好玩id的过气老登","avatar":"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06"},"text":"那挑个你喜欢的，我还能推！[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1739961475201,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"802005614","root":"802005614","user":{"id":"55513717","name":"森崎唱歌好好听","avatar":"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3"},"text":"现在申请还来得及吗？[emot=acfun,1687/]另外我真的想知道，水姐你们那边《谭谈交通》真的那么火？","time":1739880242505,"floor":4,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"802012124","root":"802005614","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"成都人都爱看，不过都是小时候的事情了[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1739936041090,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"802012373","root":"802005614","user":{"id":"55513717","name":"森崎唱歌好好听","avatar":"00af64e9f114128aa20